<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5124"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->George<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->George<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, January 27, 2005 - 8:24 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->That&#39;s right, Tfoth. I show genuine concern due to your original post and you crack wise about it. <BR>Good to see you haven&#39;t changed your behavior one bit from a different board. In no way are you stupid, and you made a couple of brilliant puns. I like intelligent people and that&#39;s why I was concerned. Okay then, let&#39;s do it your way. Ready? <i>&#34;Introduction: Assumptions. Illusion.&#34;</i> <font color="0000ff">Illusion is the key word of your theory, although your assumptions are more interesting.</font><i>Convolution of evidence over time. P.T. Barnum.</i><font color="0000ff">I agree about Barnum and you&#39;re being about as objective as he was, too.</font> <i>It’s all here. Wichita’s BTK has put on quite the show for the past thirty years.</i><font color="0000ff">Actually, BTK put on a show for maybe five years; the other twenty-five years, BTK was assumed dead.</font>  <BR> <BR><i>We have all been played - we are indeed, the fiddles of the riddles.</i> <i>However, I have reviewed the evidence, read all the postings, and cannot agree with, or produce, an evidentiary-based conclusion that we are looking at a male perp. In fact, I conclude just the opposite.</i> <font color="0000ff">I conclude you have an axe to grind and are presenting a female perp solely to obfuscate.</font> <i>&#34;Subject 1: Semen at the scene: Basic, simple and fundamental to “the game”. The Perp’s generation practiced basic birth control &#40;think balloon&#41; and so she most likely had an “unwitting” donor.</i> <font color="0000ff">Which years are the perp&#39;s generation? What form of birth control? As you state it, condoms were the only birth control method used. Why do you dismiss birth control pills, IUD&#39;s, diaphrams, the Rhythm Method and coitus interruptus? A legitimate question, I&#39;m interested in your thoughts about summarily excluding these other methods of birth control which were and are practiced by tens of millions.</font> <i>The DNA LE has, or <b>pretends</b> to have.&#34;</i> <font color="0000ff">That&#39;s odd because Mr V. was released by WPD due to a DNA non-match. It seems WPD had BTK&#39;s DNA on hand; if you&#39;d really &#34;reviewed all the evidence and read all the postings,&#34; you&#39;d know this.</font><i>But, oddly enough, this same perp goes to a very visible public pay phone on a city street and reports the Fox murder. What’s wrong with this picture?</i> <font color="0000ff">Nothing. It&#39;s a form of taunting, not unlike Zodiac, Kemper, Weepy-voiced killer in Minnesota and many others.</font>  <BR> <BR><i>This was a planned and deliberate illusion, another act in “the play”, only this one “on-stage”, deliberately. Why? Audiovisual mind stimulation. A male voice is heard, and a male suspect is spotted, that was the only purpose. Therefore, to be contrary to P.T. Barnum’s’ concepts, when the audience’s attention is drawn to something so obvious, look the other direction. Conclusion: This is a Female perp.</i> <font color="0000ff">In the name of Belle Gunness, how did you arive at this conclusion? Give me two solid, non-subjective reasons. Two. That&#39;s all.</font> <BR> <BR> <i>This perp enjoys making things very simple so that her obvious superior intellect provides her self-indulging entertainment.</i> <font color="0000ff">Go easy on autobiographical fantasy.</font> <i>Females Note: a little dirt on the face for a 5 o’clock shadow, and the right clothes can quickly give you the desired visual affect.</i> <font color="0000ff">Are you at liberty to reveal your source as to this classified information about dirt and whiskers having a like appearance?</font> <i>Note MPD sufferers: you can simply substitute your male voice for the recording above.</i> <font color="0000ff">I admit this nugget immensely helps your credibility. <BR>There is one aspect in your theory which you&#39;ve inadvertently omitted. Please let me know how the Oteros, Brights, Vian, Wegerle and letter to Williams fit in to your theory. I know they were only victims but I&#39;m a stickler for detail. I thank you for your well thought-out theory and is Jill the Ripper the great-great grandmother of this distaff BTK? Thanks again.</font>  <BR>  <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5124-->
