</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Wichitan<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, January 27, 2005 - 8:29 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Tfoth first do you live in wichita?  Second why the interest in the phone company.  Third what did you mean in your reply, &#34;I am not on steriods&#34; in responce to well if BTK were a woman at what level of horse steriods would she have to be on to talk like a man in the phone call. <BR> <BR>wichitan<!--/Text--></td></tr>
