</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Wichitan<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, January 28, 2005 - 10:50 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Dont want you to stop posting, but after all the information out there, we know for a fact BTK is a man.  The tape recording, maybe we could excluded the semen theory, man or woman, I read somwhere that there was more semen than could be produced by one man.  Again that is message board sleuthing, is it the &#34;facts&#34;....NO.  But it is interesting that it is out there.  I felt as if not only were you trying out a theory, but you were also i felt trying to play the role.  I appoligize if I offened you in anyway.  I was going to say I live in wichita, and If you were a woman, and were BTK, I was going to invite you to a wrestlling match at oh say Watson Park. <BR> <BR>wichitan <!--/Text--></td></tr>
