<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5193"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Tfoth<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tfoth<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, January 28, 2005 - 1:05 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->You folks are like the mafia.  “You try to get away….but they pullll you back in…” <BR>George’s earlier diagnosis of paranoia seems to have now taken hold… in fact I’m a little scared, so I’ll be brief. <BR> <BR>Approach: Based on the psychological formula of disorders as described before, and understanding that if indeed true, then odds favor a female, then:  Theorize Female perp. <BR>Role Play: &#40;Yes, play the role&#41;.  I am now a female SK.  What do I do? <BR>1.	Leave semen at the scene, on purpose, as described subject 1 OP. <BR>2.	Make Fox call, on purpose, as described subject 2 OP. <BR>3.	I don’t need to be strong, as I am the most clever individual that has ever lived.  I am a master manipulator.  I am so good, I amaze myself sometimes.  &#40;damn – this Histrionic Personality Disorder is going to be my downfall yet&#41; <BR>4.	I let people see that I am “a man” – heh heh heh <BR>5.	Sure glad I learn these boy scout knots from the kids, came in handy.  Now some think I must be some kind of delta force navy seal – I got em spinning I tell ya. <BR>6.	I literally got away with murder 8? times.  That would make me a “successful” criminal – damn I’m good.  Best ever.  But that’s not good enough for me.  I am more than that, so much more. I…..am invincible. <BR>7.	Hey, these people have forgotten about me!  But I’m too old to kill now.  Shucks. Memories…. <BR>8.	I’ll show them I’m still around, how dare they forget me!!!  Don’t they realize who I am?  Look at me! Look at me!  &#40;damn this HPD – it’s gonna get me in the end&#41; <BR> <BR>Wich: “we know for a fact BTK is a man”  That’s all I needed to put this to bed.  Now, give me that, and the theory has been disproved.  Semen? Nope.   Phone Call? Nope.  Strength required. Nope.  DNA pointers=Male, Nope.  Descriptions? Nope   But the Odds? Nope. <BR>But this requires exclusion of Bright.  Yes, maybe, it does.  But if we don’t exclude bright, we might have convoluted evidence to the point where it has actually blinded us. <BR> <BR>Female Host &#43; MPD &#43; Necromancy &#43; HPD = PUTZ, the artist formerly known as BTK. <BR> <BR>Internet connection: $20 <BR>Message Board participation: Disturbing <BR>Bustin PUTZ:  PRICELESS <BR>-T.Foth – Over and out. <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
