ry, sex change, cross dresser might not be so far fetched.  No one is looking for a woman.  Have they been swabbing women?  Doubtful.  The whole BTK story has been far fetched so far.  I tend to think the answer is going to be very simple. But and Assistant DA friend is always using the saying that sometimes truth is stranger than fiction.  He would know. <BR> <BR>PS - He seems to be an unremarkable looking man.  I can&#39;t imagine he would make a very attractive woman! <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
