<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5280"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Teardrop<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Teardrop<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, January 29, 2005 - 10:23 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Tfoth: I am glad to see that you think that PJs means pajamas. I believe that it does as well. He does have a thing for lingerie. BTK is clever and cunning, but I think that he is being given too much credit for being mystical by attributing hidden meanings to his letters and actions. He does have a thing for 3&#39;s. Perhaps it is as simple as the saying that &#34;death comes in three&#39;s&#34;. <BR> <BR>A cross-dresser/hermaphrodite/trans-sexual, etc.: I cannot say. I would venture to say that he does have some physiological issues at times, but I think that females are an approach-avoidance problem for him. &#40;He loves them to death.&#41; I do think that there was a woman in his past who hurt him deeply, enough to provoke him to be the killer that he has become. I doubt that he would want to pass as female. We will never know until he is examined, or tells us that info.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
