<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6286"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Tfoth<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tfoth<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, February 05, 2005 - 7:06 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->GEORGE:   Resp to post 1/27 this thread: <BR>I’m sorry you have such a problem with me George.  I saw you reported me to the website “authorities” at “Talking to Tom”.  You said I had an “agenda” and was out to “get you”.  And this after you had diagnosed me as a delusional paranoid.  You will allow me, I hope, to savor the irony?  In site mgmts response to your report, I was dismissed as a “certain amount of craziness which should be expected on the board”, as well as included in a statistical population of “kooks”.  Seems you are “well connected” George.  Now I am the ragged old lady with the shopping cart who shuffles along and mumbles incoherently.  I kind of like it.  In answer to your relevant questions: <BR>-	I believe public portion of the BTK story started in 1974, that would be more 30 years, not five.  The “missing” years you mention “he” was presumed gone are still a part of the overall story, and I consider that time another 25 years of potential evidence. <BR>-	I have not been on other boards, or used other names, and have no axe to grind.  Nor did I present the theory of a female perp in order to obfuscate.  I am presented the theory of a female perp because the possibility seemed to have been dismissed and I’m not sure why.  I can understand the “need” for the perp to be male, and it is certainly a more “comfortable” conclusion. <BR>-	I am not dismissing that other forms of birth control exist.  The act of harvesting semen would seem most efficient based the method reviewed.  I should have simply said “Semen could be collected” – thus avoiding an unnecessary tangent discussion on birth control methodology. <BR>-	Yes, Mr. V was released apparently from a DNA non-match.  This does not tell me that they have BTK’s DNA.  They could bring in a suspect tomorrow, and release him because “the prints don’t match.”  Many would conclude therefore LE has BTK’s prints.  I would not conclude the same.  I would conclude only that at least they want others to think they have “his” prints, and actually may, or may not.  My unwillingness to quickly assume or conclude does not make me paranoid; it is simply a tool to avoid false conclusions. <BR>-	I don’t personally believe the Fox call was just taunting.  What made the Fox call unique was it was “heard”, and “witnessed” in a public place.  Neither was required for taunting.   <BR>-	“In the name of Belle Gunness” – Great ref, had to look it up WOW !– OK, that was a good one.  <BR>-	I proposed the perp is female as part of a theoretical process.  I may have worded it somewhat absolute just to get things going.  The obvious answer is Geo, I cannot offer PROOF to the theory, subjective, objective, or otherwise.  If I could do that, I would be giving the info to LE, not a message board.  It is a theory, which so far remains unproved, as well as yet to be disproved. <BR>-	Dirt on face - No source – just a simple illustration. <BR>-	I did not “inadvertently omit the victims”.  Your statement “I know they were only victims” seems to allude that I have a callous attitude toward these crimes.  I can assure you that is not the case.  If I didn’t care, I would be spending my time elsewhere.  I also feel for the victims who are yet unknown, the living, who don’t even know yet just how much their lives are about to be changed resulting from the conclusion of this investigation.  Victims abound and more victims are pending.  And unlike some posters and the mgmt of this site, I am aware of the Victim to Victimizer sequence, and never would urge, encourage or justify its continuation.  Breaking the chain is the courageous act and a true badge of honor, and to do so is an act of intelligence, integrity and internal strength. <BR> <BR>ICE: Resp to Post 1/28 this thread <BR>-	Loved the snow shoveling. <BR> <BR>STEALTH: Resp to Post 1/28 this thread <BR>-	Appreciate your POV and thanks for at least considering this <BR> <BR>BLUEP:  Resp to Post 1/28 <BR>-	Not my intention to play anyone. <BR> <BR>TEARDROP: Resp to Post 1/29 this thread <BR>-	Re: PJ’s -There is a BTK “chapter”….and a poem, and it sounds like another poem…and that poem was used by a prof at WSU…and there’s photocopy machines at WSU …and that Prof had initials of PJ … So: Chapter = Ref to Prof. Yes, there is some dot connecting there I just have never quite been able to follow.  And that makes me wonder about other dot connecting that has happened.  I think the recent drops may be just a mixture of “treasure” with a completely random potpourri of meaningless “stuff” that the perp knows will then just take on a life of its own, and a goose or two will be chased.  Hopefully we will soon just run out of geese.   <BR> <BR>NANCYDREW: The world needs more NancyDrews <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
